#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "You doin' this!"
msgstr "넌 할 수 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Good luck with Canada!"
msgstr "캐나다까지 무사히 가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Keep moving! That's the best way to not get bit!"
msgstr "계속 움직여! 그래야 안 물리지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "I used to have a flamethrower but a teammate stole it"
msgstr "나도 화염방사기가 있었는데 동료가 훔쳐 갔어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Don't trade away too much food, you might need it later"
msgstr "식량을 너무 많이 바꾸진 마. 나중에 필요할 수도 있어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Don't hoard your food, trade it before bandits get it!"
msgstr "식량 쌓아 두지 마. 약탈자들이 가져가기 전에 거래해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Is the Death Road really as bad as the name implies?"
msgstr "데스 로드는 정말 이름처럼 끔찍해?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "What is this... Can-adoh you speak of?"
msgstr "네가 말하는 그... 캐나더인가 뭔가가 뭐야?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "What's your favorite type of canned food?"
msgstr "어떤 통조림을 제일 좋아해?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Can gasoline go bad?"
msgstr "휘발유도 상하나?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Who in their right mind would crawl into a gas tank?"
msgstr "제정신인 사람이 기름 탱크 안에 기어들어 가겠어?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " EVERY DAY ON THE DEATH ROAD! IS A DAY TO MAKE FRIENDS! "
msgstr " 데스 로드의 매일매일은! 친구를 만드는 날! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " Every day on the Death Road is a new adventuuuure! "
msgstr " 데스 로드의 매일매일은 새로운 모허어어엄! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "I'm taking a little break before I get back on the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드에 다시 나가기 전에 잠깐 쉬고 있어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Someone needs to fix the roads! "
msgstr "누가 도로 좀 고쳐야겠어! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Just take things a day at a time"
msgstr "하루하루 차근차근 버텨 봐"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "I would trade my fortune for a real roll of toilet paper"
msgstr "진짜 화장지 한 롤만 있으면 전 재산과 바꾸겠어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Secret tip: Shopping carts are the ultimate weapon "
msgstr "비밀 팁: 쇼핑카트가 궁극의 무기야 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Keep dying? GIT GUD "
msgstr "자꾸 죽어? 실력 좀 키워 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "I AM ERROR"
msgstr "나는 에러다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Think you can make it to Canada? That's horse trash!"
msgstr "캐나다까지 갈 수 있다고? 말똥 같은 소리 하네!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Hi. Be kind to animals."
msgstr "안녕. 동물을 친절하게 대해 줘."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "HEY! GET OUT OF OUR HOUSE!"
msgstr "야! 우리 집에서 나가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "Feel that PUMP!"
msgstr "근육이 빵빵해지는 걸 느껴!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "NO PAIN!"
msgstr "고통 없인!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid "NO GAIN!"
msgstr "얻는 것도 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " gets FREE training with firearms! "
msgstr "은(는) 공짜 사격 훈련을 받는다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " already feels like a steadier shot."
msgstr "는 벌써 조준이 더 안정적인 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "It didn't actually help "
msgstr "훈련이 실제로 도움 되지는 않았다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " shooting, but it was FREE!"
msgstr "의 사격은 그대로지만 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:29
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:131
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:210
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:361
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" accidentally just comes off as creepy. \r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 의도치 않게 소름 끼치는 모습만 보인다. \r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:30
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:132
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:211
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:288
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:362
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " is asked to leave."
msgstr "은(는) 나가 달라는 말을 듣는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " learns some new tricks with firearms! Zombies beware."
msgstr "은(는) 새로운 사격 요령을 배운다! 좀비들, 조심해라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " didn't really learn anything new. "
msgstr "은(는) 딱히 새로 배우는 게 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " had already picked up these tricks on "
msgstr "는 이미 이런 요령을 익혔다. 모두 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " own."
msgstr " 독학 덕분이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "The entire group gets firearms training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 사격 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Who should get the training in firearms handling?"
msgstr "누가 총기 취급 훈련을 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " farts really loudly at the firearms coach, and then rolls around."
msgstr "은(는) 사격 강사에게 엄청 큰 방귀를 뀌고 뒹군다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:64
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:164
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:243
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:320
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " quips "
msgstr "은(는) 빈정댄다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:64
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:164
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:243
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:320
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT"
msgstr "말로 해, 침 튀기지 말고"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " to the firearms coach."
msgstr " . 사격 강사에게 하는 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"A miracle happens: she decides to not shoot!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"기적이 일어난다. 총을 쏘지 않기로 한 것이다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "You seem like you need all the help you can get..."
msgstr "네가 받을 수 있는 도움은 다 필요해 보이네..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe teaches her secret gun tricks to "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀가 비밀 사격 요령을 가르쳐 준다. 대상: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Her reaction is brief disgust."
msgstr "잠시 역겹다는 반응을 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tOh. Yeah, ok. You're one of those types, huh?"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t아. 그래, 알겠어. 넌 그런 부류구나?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe alerts the rest of the camp that "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀가 야영지 사람들에게 알린다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " is a huge dingus, and "
msgstr "은(는) 엄청난 등신이라고 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " is forced to leave."
msgstr "은(는) 쫓겨난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Firearms Coach"
msgstr "사격 강사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"This rifle-wielding woman claims she used to train others in competitive shooting. \r\n"
"\tShe is selling tips for keeping your aim steady and multiple target trick shots. "
msgstr ""
"소총을 든 이 여성은 사격 대회 선수들을 가르쳤다고 한다. \r\n"
"\t안정적인 조준과 여러 표적을 맞히는 묘기 사격 요령을 팔고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Zombies are slow moving targets. It's real easy!"
msgstr "좀비는 느리게 움직이는 표적이야. 아주 쉽지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:82
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:180
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:260
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:334
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "This isn't enough food to buy training."
msgstr "훈련을 받을 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:86
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:184
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:264
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:338
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Give 6 food for training"
msgstr "식량 6개로 훈련 받기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:88
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:186
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:266
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:340
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Give "
msgstr "지불하기: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:88
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:186
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:266
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:340
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " food for group training"
msgstr " 식량 - 단체 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:92
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:190
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:270
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:344
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:418
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " uses charm"
msgstr "은(는) 매력 발휘하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:95
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:193
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:273
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:347
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:421
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ": SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT"
msgstr ": 침 튀기지 말고 말해"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" flexes once, using only half effort. But the contest is already decided.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 힘을 반만 써서 근육을 한 번 과시한다. 하지만 승부는 이미 결정된다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "IMPOSSIBLE! THIS IS IMPOSSIBLE!"
msgstr "불가능해! 이건 불가능해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" shrieks the Strength Trainer, in a strangely high-pitched voice.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
" 하고 근력 트레이너가 이상하게 높은 목소리로 비명을 지른다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "ARE YOU 'THE SWOLE THAT WAS PROMISED'?"
msgstr "네가 바로 '약속된 근육'이냐?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" and then he turns into stone and, moments later, shatters into a million "
"fragments."
msgstr " 그러더니 돌로 변하고, 잠시 후 백만 조각으로 산산조각 난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " wins the pose-off!"
msgstr "은(는) 근육 포즈 대결에서 이긴다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "It was pretty hard to win a flexing competition as an animal!"
msgstr "동물로서 근육 과시 대결을 이기는 건 꽤 어려웠다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" loses the pose-off. \r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 근육 포즈 대결에서 진다. \r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " feels "
msgstr "는 느낀다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "GREAT SHAME."
msgstr "극심한 수치심."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " gets FREE strength training! "
msgstr "은(는) 공짜 근력 훈련을 받는다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" already clearly feels a 'pump', as the bodybuilders used to say before they"
" were all wiped out."
msgstr "는 벌써 확실히 근육이 빵빵해진 기분이다. 보디빌더들이 전멸하기 전에 하던 말대로라면 '펌핑'이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:126
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:206
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:283
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:357
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "It didn't actually improve "
msgstr "훈련이 실제로 향상시키지는 못했다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " strength, but it was FREE!"
msgstr "의 근력은 그대로지만 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " gets all pumped up from the strength training regiment!"
msgstr "은(는) 근력 훈련으로 온몸의 근육이 빵빵해진다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " was not impressed with that dinky little workout. "
msgstr "은(는) 그 하찮은 운동에 감흥이 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " needs to find a better routine!"
msgstr "는 더 좋은 운동법을 찾아야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "The entire group gets strength training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 근력 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Who should get this INTENSE strength workout?"
msgstr "누가 이 빡센 근력 훈련을 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " farts really loudly at the strength trainer."
msgstr "은(는) 근력 트레이너에게 엄청 큰 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " to the strength trainer."
msgstr " . 근력 트레이너에게 하는 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"YEAH! THAT'S THE ATTITUDE YOU NEED TO MAKE IT AS A TOP BODYBUILDER! WE WILL "
"REBUILD THE SPORT! YEAH!"
msgstr "그래! 최고의 보디빌더가 되려면 그런 태도가 필요하지! 이 종목을 부활시키자! 그래!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe takes "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그가 수제자로 받아들이는 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " on as his top student, to get HUGE at a mind destroying pace!"
msgstr "이다. 정신이 무너질 속도로 거대해지는 훈련이 시작된다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "He doesn't take this well."
msgstr "그는 이를 좋게 받아들이지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tGET OUT OF HERE YOU DWEEBUS! YOU DON'T DESERVE TO GET HUGE!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t여기서 나가, 이 얼간아! 넌 거대해질 자격이 없어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe continues yelling until "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그는 계속 소리친다. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " leave the trading camp."
msgstr "은(는) 상인 야영지를 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Strength Trainer"
msgstr "근력 트레이너"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"It's an old but fit man in matching gray sweatpants and sweatshirt. He "
"screams something about "
msgstr "회색 운동복을 맞춰 입은 나이 들고 건장한 남자다. 소리치는 말은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "BUILDING MASS AND BULK"
msgstr "근육과 덩치를 키워라"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " with an "
msgstr " . 비법은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "INTENSE STRENGTH ROUTINE!"
msgstr "빡센 근력 운동!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tHe flails towards some heavy objects lying around."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t주변에 널린 무거운 물건들을 향해 팔다리를 휘젓는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Sadly, this isn't enough food to get huge."
msgstr "슬프게도 거대해질 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " declares a pose off!"
msgstr "은(는) 근육 포즈 대결을 선언한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " gets FREE fitness training! "
msgstr "은(는) 공짜 체력 훈련을 받는다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " sweats from the intense exercise!"
msgstr "는 격한 운동으로 땀을 흘린다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " fitness, but it was FREE!"
msgstr "의 체력은 그대로지만 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " works up a huge sweat from the fitness routine!"
msgstr "은(는) 체력 운동으로 엄청난 땀을 흘린다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" didn't even break a sweat! The Fitness Instructor is confused, even she got"
" a little tired."
msgstr "은(는) 땀 한 방울도 나지 않는다! 체력 강사는 당황한다. 자신도 조금 지쳤는데."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "The entire group gets fitness training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 체력 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Who wants strenuous exercise for the sake of fitness?"
msgstr "체력을 위한 격한 운동을 누가 하고 싶을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " farts in a high pitch at the fitness instructor."
msgstr "은(는) 체력 강사에게 높은 소리로 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " to the fitness instructor."
msgstr " . 체력 강사에게 하는 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear! You're ready for the MIRACLE FITNESS ROUTINE!"
msgstr "바로 그 말을 듣고 싶었어! 넌 기적의 체력 운동을 할 준비가 됐구나!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tIt's likely that she just heard "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t아마 그녀는 잘못 들은 것 같다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " wrong. An incredible, cutting edge series of calisthenics follows."
msgstr "의 말을 오해한 뒤 놀라운 최첨단 맨몸 운동을 가르친다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Her reaction is mostly disappointment."
msgstr "주로 실망한 반응이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tYeah, well, have fun getting eaten by zombies."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그래, 뭐, 좀비한테 맛있게 먹혀 봐."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe jogs backwards until she's out of sight. "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 시야에서 사라질 때까지 뒤로 달린다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " is so embarassed by this that "
msgstr "은(는) 너무 창피해한다. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " forced to leave the camp."
msgstr "은(는) 야영지를 떠나야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Fitness Instructor"
msgstr "체력 강사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"This woman is decked out in sweat bands, limb warmers, and garish exercise clothes.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 여성은 땀밴드와 팔다리 보온대, 요란한 운동복으로 무장했다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"Only the fittest will survive in this zombie filled world! I can help you "
"get fit, fast!"
msgstr "좀비로 가득한 세상에선 체력이 좋은 사람만 살아남아! 빠르게 체력을 키우도록 도와줄게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe's been continuously running in place this whole time."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t그녀는 내내 제자리에서 달리고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Sadly, this isn't enough food for fitness."
msgstr "슬프게도 체력을 키울 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " gets FREE medical training!"
msgstr "은(는) 공짜 의술 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " medical knowledge, but it was FREE!"
msgstr "의 의학 지식은 그대로지만 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" accidentally just comes off as creepy, even by the standards of the EZ Medical College: Creepy Murder Van Campus. \r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 의도치 않게 소름 끼치는 모습만 보인다. EZ 의과대학의 소름 끼치는 살인 밴 캠퍼스 기준으로도 그렇다. \r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" learns new things about emergency medical care from the knowledgeable "
"filth-man."
msgstr "은(는) 지식 많은 지저분한 남자에게 응급 치료법을 새로 배운다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Although the filthy professor was a great teacher, "
msgstr "지저분한 교수는 훌륭한 교사였지만 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " didn't learn anything new."
msgstr "은(는) 새로 배운 게 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "The entire group gets medical training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 의술 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Who should get the medical training?"
msgstr "누가 의술 훈련을 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" somehow manages to say something like SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT in a weird "
"animal voice."
msgstr "은(는) 기묘한 동물 목소리로 침 튀기지 말고 말로 하라는 소리를 어떻게든 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " to the overalls man."
msgstr " . 멜빵 작업복 남자에게 하는 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "He nods with sage wisdom. Maybe he misheard "
msgstr "그는 현자처럼 고개를 끄덕인다. 혹시 잘못 들었나? "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"? He proceeds to teach incredible zombie survival medical techniques the "
"likes of which have never been seen."
msgstr "의 말을? 그는 지금껏 본 적 없는 놀라운 좀비 생존 의술을 가르친다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "*YOU* DON'T SAY IT OR SPRAY IT! AAAAAAAARGH!"
msgstr "*네가* 침도 말도 튀기지 마! 으아아아아악!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe is infuriated! "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그가 격노한다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:326
#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " is forced to leave the camp."
msgstr "은(는) 야영지에서 쫓겨난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "EZ Medical College"
msgstr "EZ 의과대학"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:332
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " discovers an unsettling and filthy van. It has a sign that says "
msgstr "은(는) 불안하고 지저분한 밴을 발견한다. 뒤 문에 걸린 간판에는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:332
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "EZ MEDICAL COLLEGE"
msgstr "EZ 의과대학"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:332
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" hanging crookedly on the back door.\r\n"
"\tInside is an unsettling and filthy dude in overalls. "
msgstr ""
"이라고 비뚤게 적혀 있다.\r\n"
"\t안에는 멜빵 작업복을 입은 불안하고 지저분한 남자가 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:333
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "WELL? WHO WANTS TO LEARN ABOUT SURGERY?"
msgstr "그래서? 누가 수술을 배우고 싶어?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:336
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "This isn't enough food to learn about surgery."
msgstr "수술을 배울 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " gets FREE training in the art and science of anti-zombie engineering!"
msgstr "은(는) 대좀비 공학의 예술과 과학을 공짜로 배운다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:357
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " mechanical skill, but it was FREE!"
msgstr "의 기계 기술은 그대로지만 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" gets a crash course in repair, effective barricades, and other anti-zombie "
"engineering!"
msgstr "은(는) 수리, 효과적인 바리케이드, 그 밖의 대좀비 공학을 속성으로 배운다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " didn't learn anything new. "
msgstr "은(는) 새로 배운 게 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " was already aware of all the stuff the mechanic could teach."
msgstr "는 정비사가 가르칠 수 있는 것들을 이미 전부 알고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "The entire group gets mechanic training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 기계 기술 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " farts really loudly at the mechanic, in a low pitch."
msgstr "은(는) 정비사에게 엄청 크고 낮은 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " to the mechanic."
msgstr " . 정비사에게 하는 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "She finds this hilarious! Delighted, the mechanic pledges to give "
msgstr "그녀는 웃겨 죽겠다고 한다! 기뻐하는 정비사가 약속한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid " an intense crash course in absolutely everything she knows."
msgstr "에게 자신이 아는 모든 것을 빡센 속성 강좌로 가르쳐 주겠다고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"She responds to this by digging into her pockets for a bolt, then throwing "
"it at "
msgstr "그녀는 주머니에서 볼트를 꺼내 던지는 것으로 대답한다. 표적: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ". She continues doing this, not saying a word, until "
msgstr ". 아무 말도 없이 계속 던진다. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Who should get the mechanic's training?"
msgstr "누가 정비사의 훈련을 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:404
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "Mechanic Savant"
msgstr "기계 천재"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:405
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
" meets a woman wearing oil stained coveralls.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 기름 얼룩진 작업복을 입은 여성을 만난다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"I can help you get better at repairing stuff. It's a real handy skill. Might"
" save your life."
msgstr "수리를 더 잘하게 도와줄 수 있어. 정말 쓸모 있는 기술이지. 목숨을 구할 수도 있어."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tA high mechanic skill lets you fix your car."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t기계 기술이 높으면 차를 수리할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/training.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/training.df"
msgid "This isn't enough food to afford training."
msgstr "훈련을 받을 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" drops some food into the dumpster slot and a grenade comes out. This could cause a lot of damage!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쓰레기통 투입구에 식량을 넣고 수류탄을 받는다. 엄청난 피해를 줄 수 있겠다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Wait, was the pin still on?"
msgstr "잠깐, 안전핀 꽂혀 있었나?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" drops some food into the dumpster and a bunch of grenades plop out, one at a time. These can come in handy!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쓰레기통에 식량을 넣는다. 수류탄 여러 개가 하나씩 툭툭 나온다. 유용하겠다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Please don't drop any of those back into here."
msgstr "그거 여기 안에 다시 넣지는 마."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" drops a lot of food into the dumpster. Someone pushes an uzi back out! It can spray out bullets at an incredible speed! Watch out, even a skilled shooter will have trouble with the recoil.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쓰레기통에 식량을 잔뜩 넣는다. 누군가 우지를 밀어낸다! 놀라운 속도로 총알을 뿌릴 수 있다! 조심하자. 사격을 잘해도 반동을 감당하기 어렵다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Have fun! Also please go away."
msgstr "즐겁게 써! 그리고 좀 가 줘."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" feeds a very large amount of food into the dumpster. There's a pause, then someone pushes an assault rifle out! This could really help the trip!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쓰레기통에 아주 많은 식량을 넣는다. 잠시 후 누군가 돌격소총을 밀어낸다! 여행에 큰 도움이 되겠다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Thanks for all the food! Good luck out there!"
msgstr "식량 잔뜩 줘서 고마워! 밖에서 행운을 빌게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" feeds a very large amount of food into the slot. There's a pause, then someone in the dumpster starts pushing a dozen grenades back through.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 투입구에 아주 많은 식량을 넣는다. 잠시 후 쓰레기통 안에서 누군가 수류탄 열두 개를 밀어내기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Be really careful with these!"
msgstr "이것들은 정말 조심해서 다뤄!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" feeds a massive amount of food into the slot. Someone on the other side strains to push a flamethrower out of the dumpster.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 투입구에 엄청난 식량을 넣는다. 반대편 사람이 힘겹게 쓰레기통 밖으로 화염방사기를 밀어낸다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Light them up!"
msgstr "불붙여 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" slowly feeds a car-load of food into the dumpster. Scraping noises are heard and then a minigun barrel is pushed through from the darkness. The frame of the slot is warped due to the size of the minigun as it's jammed through.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차 한 대 분량의 식량을 쓰레기통에 천천히 넣는다. 긁히는 소리가 들리고 어둠 속에서 미니건 총열이 밀려 나온다. 미니건이 너무 커서 억지로 밀어낼 때 투입구 틀이 휜다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Thanks so much! I can hide in here for months now!"
msgstr "정말 고마워! 이제 여기서 몇 달은 숨을 수 있겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Army Surplus Fortress"
msgstr "군용품 요새"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" finds a dumpster. It's locked tight, with a slot in the side. There are weapon names and prices scrawled near the hole.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쓰레기통을 발견한다. 단단히 잠겨 있고 옆면에 투입구가 있다. 구멍 근처에 무기 이름과 가격이 휘갈겨져 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Just drop the food in here!"
msgstr "여기 안에 식량만 넣어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " says a tiny voice in the dumpster."
msgstr " 하고 쓰레기통 안에서 작은 목소리가 들린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Leave it alone"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "This isn't enough food for the dumpster person!"
msgstr "쓰레기통 사람에게 줄 식량이 부족하다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Minigun for 75 food"
msgstr "미니건 - 식량 75개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Flamethrower for 50 food"
msgstr "화염방사기 - 식량 50개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "12 grenades for 40 food"
msgstr "수류탄 12개 - 식량 40개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:73
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Assault Rifle for 25 food"
msgstr "돌격소총 - 식량 25개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Uzi for 15 food"
msgstr "우지 - 식량 15개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "3 grenades for 12 food"
msgstr "수류탄 3개 - 식량 12개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "1 grenade for 4 food"
msgstr "수류탄 1개 - 식량 4개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " farts right in front of the shotgun guy."
msgstr "은(는) 산탄총 남자 바로 앞에서 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the shotgun guy to "
msgstr "은(는) 산탄총 남자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:98
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:184
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:279
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:373
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:456
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:624
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:819
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:918
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This causes him some sort of emotional crisis.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그에게 무슨 감정의 위기가 찾아온다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "You're right! What am I even doing with my life?!"
msgstr "네 말이 맞아! 난 지금 인생을 어떻게 살고 있는 거지?!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:102
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " his "
msgstr "에게 자신의 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "prized autoshotgun."
msgstr "아끼던 자동 산탄총을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The peddler is really annoyed by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"행상인은 정말 짜증이 난다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I'm trying to make a living here!"
msgstr "나도 먹고살려고 이러는 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe then starts blasting his shotguns into the air menacingly, forcing "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그가 위협적으로 허공에 산탄총을 쏘기 시작한다. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " to flee!"
msgstr "은(는) 도망친다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:116
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:199
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:387
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:467
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:833
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:841
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys the "
msgstr "은(는) 다음을 산다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "DOUBLE BARREL SHOTGUN!"
msgstr "쌍열 산탄총!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" A true connoisseur's shotgun. This busts out giant sprays of buckshot, but "
"is a little tough to handle."
msgstr " 진정한 감식가의 산탄총이다. 산탄을 거대하게 퍼뜨리지만 다루기는 조금 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a rifled slug shotgun. It fires a heavy, solid slug instead of "
"buckshot. A skilled shooter could destroy a solid line of zombies with each "
"shot!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 강선 슬러그 산탄총을 산다. 산탄 대신 무겁고 단단한 단일 탄환을 쏜다. 숙련된 사수라면 한 발로 일렬로 늘어선 좀비를 전부 "
"쓰러뜨릴 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys an automatic shotgun. This weapon fires way faster than a normal "
"shotgun, devastating the hordes!"
msgstr "은(는) 자동 산탄총을 산다. 보통 산탄총보다 훨씬 빠르게 쏘면서 무리를 초토화한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a shotgun. The peddler throws in some shells for free!"
msgstr "은(는) 산탄총을 산다. 행상인이 탄약을 조금 덤으로 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Shotgun Peddler"
msgstr "산탄총 행상인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This man is carrying several shotguns, most of them lashed to his back. He is booming out a simple yet effective sales pitch:\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"남자가 여러 산탄총을 들고 있다. 대부분 등 뒤에 묶여 있다. 간단하지만 효과적인 판매 문구를 우렁차게 외친다:\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "SHOTGUNS FOR SALE! SHOTGUNS FOR SAAAALE!"
msgstr "산탄총 팝니다! 산탄총 파아아압니다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:140
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:410
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:978
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Leave him"
msgstr "남자를 두고 떠나기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:142
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:415
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:665
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:781
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:983
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells him to COOL IT"
msgstr "은(는) 남자에게 진정하라고 하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "This isn't enough food! Out of pity, he gives "
msgstr "식량이 부족하다! 그가 딱하게 여겨 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " some free shotgun shells."
msgstr "에게 산탄총 탄약을 조금 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Slug Shotgun for 25 food"
msgstr "슬러그 산탄총 - 식량 25개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Autoshotty for 30 food"
msgstr "자동 산탄총 - 식량 30개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Double Barrel Shotgun for 12 food"
msgstr "쌍열 산탄총 - 식량 12개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Shotgun for 7 food"
msgstr "산탄총 - 식량 7개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " takes a look at the collection and then rolls "
msgstr "은(는) 수집품을 보고 못마땅해한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " eyes."
msgstr " 눈알이 빙그르 돈다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the friendly woman to "
msgstr "은(는) 친근한 여성에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"She nods in agreement.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그녀는 동의하며 고개를 끄덕인다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think my collection is getting too big. Mind just taking this off my"
" hands?"
msgstr "그래, 수집품이 너무 많아지는 것 같아. 이거 좀 가져가 줄래?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe collector gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t수집가는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " an "
msgstr "에게 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "assault rifle."
msgstr "돌격소총을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The rifle collector seems hurt by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"소총 수집가가 상처받은 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I... I am cool..."
msgstr "나... 나도 침착해..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe tells "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " to leave the trading camp before she brings out her minigun."
msgstr "에게 미니건 꺼내기 전에 상인 야영지에서 나가라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "MINIGUN"
msgstr "미니건"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
". The collector seems glad to sell it. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
". 수집가는 팔 수 있어서 기쁜 것 같다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:200
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Well, technically it's not a rifle! And I couldn't figure out how to hang it"
" on my wall, so..."
msgstr "엄밀히 말하면 소총은 아니지! 그리고 벽에 어떻게 걸어야 할지 모르겠어서..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a high powered hunting rifle. The collector gives you a great price on it, as she already has several.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 고성능 사냥용 소총을 산다. 수집가는 이미 여러 자루가 있어서 아주 싸게 준다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The great thing about hunting rifles is that one shot can splat a lot of "
"zombies. My record is 7 in one shot!"
msgstr "사냥용 소총은 한 발로 좀비 여러 마리를 터뜨리는 게 좋지. 내 기록은 한 발에 7마리야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys an assault rifle. Nearly as powerful as a cowboy rifle per shot, and it fires much faster.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 돌격소총을 산다. 한 발의 위력은 카우보이 소총과 거의 같고 발사는 훨씬 빠르다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I prefer the single shot rifles, personally. Automatics use up too much ammo"
" and don't pierce as well."
msgstr "난 개인적으로 단발 소총이 좋아. 자동은 탄약을 너무 많이 쓰고 관통도 잘 안 돼."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a cowboy rifle. The collector throws in some ammo for free, along with a second rifle!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 카우보이 소총을 산다. 수집가는 탄약과 두 번째 소총까지 공짜로 얹어 준다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Cowboy rifles are great for beginners. Easy to handle, fun to shoot. I find "
"tons of these, so take two!"
msgstr "카우보이 소총은 초보자한테 좋아. 다루기 쉽고 쏘는 재미도 있지. 이런 건 잔뜩 찾으니까 두 자루 가져가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys the M.O.A.R: Mother Of All Rifles. The pinnacle of slow-shot firearms, the M.O.A.R penetrates columns of zombies or cars with ease.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) M.O.A.R, 모든 소총의 어머니를 산다. 느린 발사 무기의 정점인 M.O.A.R은 좀비나 자동차의 대열도 쉽게 관통한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This beauty was banned in 58 countries, for good reason. You could really "
"hurt somebody with this thing...this is a weapon for a REAL marksman."
msgstr "이 멋진 물건은 58개국에서 금지됐어. 이유가 있지. 진짜로 누굴 다치게 할 수도 있으니까... 진짜 명사수를 위한 무기야."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Rifle Collector"
msgstr "소총 수집가"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" talks to a meek looking woman. She invites you to check out her collection of rifles.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 얌전해 보이는 여성과 말한다. 그녀가 소총 수집품을 구경하라고 권한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I've found so many that I'm looking to sell some!"
msgstr "너무 많이 찾아서 좀 팔려고 해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:232
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:869
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Leave her"
msgstr "여성을 두고 떠나기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:234
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:331
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:874
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells her to COOL IT"
msgstr "은(는) 여성에게 진정하라고 하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This isn't enough food to buy any! To be friendly, the collector gives "
msgstr "뭐든 살 식량이 부족하다! 수집가는 친절을 베풀어 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " some free rifle ammo."
msgstr "에게 소총 탄약을 조금 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Minigun for 65 food"
msgstr "미니건 - 식량 65개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "M.O.A.R Gun for 32 food"
msgstr "M.O.A.R 총 - 식량 32개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Hunting Rifle for 15 food"
msgstr "사냥용 소총 - 식량 15개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Cowboy Rifle for 10 food"
msgstr "카우보이 소총 - 식량 10개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " says the phrase "
msgstr "은(는) 이 말을 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "COOL IT"
msgstr "진정해"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " by farting! Amazing!"
msgstr " . 방귀로! 놀랍다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the fanatical woman to "
msgstr "은(는) 광적인 여성에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"She's delighted by this, somehow.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"어째서인지 그녀는 기뻐한다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "WHOA!...WHOAAAAAAA!"
msgstr "우와!... 우와아아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe trader gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " 7 molotovs and a "
msgstr "에게 화염병 7개와 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "free chainsaw."
msgstr "공짜 전기톱을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The weapons trader is infuriated by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"무기 상인이 격노한다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"COOL IT? COOL IT??! LOSERS COOL IT!!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"진정해? 진정해??! 패배자나 진정하는 거야!!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" realizes that this was a pretty bad idea! The trader revs up her chainsaw!"
msgstr "은(는) 아주 나쁜 생각이었다고 깨닫는다! 상인이 전기톱 엔진을 돌린다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a couple of molotov cocktails.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염병 두 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "A little fire can go a long way!"
msgstr "작은 불꽃이 멀리까지 번질 수 있지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys five molotov cocktails.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염병 다섯 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:300
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "When in doubt, burn it all down!!"
msgstr "모르겠으면 전부 태워 버려!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys eight molotov cocktails.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염병 여덟 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Don't use them all in one place!"
msgstr "한 군데에 전부 쓰진 마!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:309
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a parking meter? It's very heavy.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 주차 요금기를 산다? 아주 무겁다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"We ripped this out of the ground! That's how we can pass the savings on to "
"you!"
msgstr "땅에서 뽑아 왔어! 그래서 이렇게 싸게 파는 거지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:314
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a chainsaw! It converts spare gas into zombie destruction.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 전기톱을 산다! 남는 기름을 좀비 파괴로 바꿔 준다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Hahaha! PERFECT! Rip them all apart!"
msgstr "하하하! 완벽해! 전부 찢어 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a flamethrower! Try not to shoot your team members with it.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염방사기를 산다! 동료에게 쏘지 않도록 하자.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Aaaaaaa! Looks GREAT on you!!"
msgstr "아아아! 너한테 정말 잘 어울려!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Carnage Weapons"
msgstr "학살 무기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"A particularly intense looking woman offers to sell you a spare weapon. "
msgstr "유독 강렬해 보이는 여성이 여분의 무기를 팔겠다고 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I only carry the BEST stuff!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"난 최고의 물건만 들고 다녀!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "She starts her chainsaw and revs it a few times to emphasize this."
msgstr "그 말에 힘을 싣듯 전기톱에 시동을 걸고 몇 번 엔진을 돌린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:329
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:549
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:588
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1050
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1105
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1156
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This isn't enough food to buy anything! The trader gives a free molotov to "
msgstr "아무것도 살 식량이 부족하다! 상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ", just to promote zombie destruction."
msgstr "에게 공짜 화염병을 준다. 좀비 파괴를 장려하기 위해서다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Flamethrower for 40 food"
msgstr "화염방사기 - 식량 40개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:340
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Chainsaw for 20 food"
msgstr "전기톱 - 식량 20개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "8 molotovs for 15 food"
msgstr "화염병 8개 - 식량 15개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Parking meter for 10 food"
msgstr "주차 요금기 - 식량 10개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "5 molotovs for 10 food"
msgstr "화염병 5개 - 식량 10개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "2 molotovs for 5 food"
msgstr "화염병 2개 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "The Blade Master manages to fight off "
msgstr "검의 달인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " using his considerable sword knowledge and mall katanas. "
msgstr "을(를) 해박한 검술 지식과 쇼핑몰 카타나로 막아낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " nabs a sturdy machete."
msgstr "은(는) 튼튼한 마체테를 낚아챈다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " starts gnawing on one of the Blade Master's scabbards, in spite."
msgstr "은(는) 심술이 나서 검의 달인의 칼집 하나를 갉아먹기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the Blade Master to "
msgstr "은(는) 검의 달인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"He becomes filled with self-doubt.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그는 자기 의심에 사로잡힌다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"My life is a lie! I'm going to give up this sword stuff and start collecting"
" flamethrowers."
msgstr "내 인생은 거짓이었어! 검은 때려치우고 화염방사기나 모아야겠다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe former Blade Master gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t검의 달인이었던 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:378
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " one of his best weapons, a "
msgstr "에게 최고의 무기 중 하나인 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:378
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Knight's Sword."
msgstr "기사의 검을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:381
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The Blade Master ignores this.\r\n"
"\t\tHe starts talking about how cool swords are and never stops. "
msgstr ""
"검의 달인은 무시한다.\r\n"
"\t\t검이 얼마나 멋진지 끝없이 떠들기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " is forced to sneak out of the trading camp during his endless raving."
msgstr "은(는) 끝없는 광설을 듣다가 상인 야영지에서 몰래 빠져나온다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "MIGHTY CLAYMORE"
msgstr "강력한 클레이모어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
". The claymore is slow and hard to handle, but extremely powerful. It can "
"chop 4 zombies at once!"
msgstr ". 클레이모어는 느리고 다루기 어렵지만 엄청나게 강하다. 한 번에 좀비 네 마리를 벨 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:392
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys the type of sword a knight in the middle ages would use. This will "
"make a great weapon! It can easily hit two zombies in one swing."
msgstr "은(는) 중세 기사가 쓸 법한 검을 산다. 훌륭한 무기가 될 것이다! 한 번 휘둘러 좀비 두 마리를 쉽게 맞힐 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a very strong yet light machete. It's sturdy enough to chop down trees"
" with, so it won't break with 'road trip usage'."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 튼튼하면서도 가벼운 마체테를 산다. 나무도 벨 만큼 튼튼해서 '도로 여행용'으로 쓴다고 부서지지는 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a katana of the type you'd get at a mall. It looks like it might break"
" at any moment. What a rip off."
msgstr "은(는) 쇼핑몰에서나 살 법한 카타나를 산다. 언제든 부서질 것 같다. 완전 바가지다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:407
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Blade Master"
msgstr "검의 달인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" meets a man who is carrying many swords. They clank around as he moves.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 검을 많이 들고 다니는 남자를 만난다. 움직일 때마다 달그락거린다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:409
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"One day I'll make the finest zombie slicing sword ever seen! I just have to "
"figure out how to make swords first. I'll sell you some I found!"
msgstr "언젠가 최고의 좀비 베기 검을 만들 거야! 일단 검 만드는 법부터 알아야 하지만. 주운 검 몇 자루 팔아 줄게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:412
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:662
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:778
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:871
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:980
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " robs the trader"
msgstr "은(는) 상인 털기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:418
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:877
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:986
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1048
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This isn't enough food to buy anything! As consolation the trader gives "
msgstr "아무것도 살 식량이 부족하다! 상인은 위로 삼아 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:418
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a butcher's cleaver."
msgstr "에게 정육용 식칼을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:421
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Mighty Claymore for 35 food"
msgstr "강력한 클레이모어 - 식량 35개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Knight's Sword for 20 food"
msgstr "기사의 검 - 식량 20개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:427
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Sturdy Machete for 12 food"
msgstr "튼튼한 마체테 - 식량 12개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:430
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Cheap Katana for 5 food"
msgstr "싸구려 카타나 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:444
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " robs the axe merchant, who stands there without responding at all. "
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 상인을 턴다. 상인은 아무 반응 없이 서 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:444
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " takes the medieval axe but gets creeped out. "
msgstr "은(는) 중세 도끼를 챙기지만 소름이 돋는다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:446
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " also creeped out."
msgstr "도 소름이 돋는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The axe merchant moves way too fast. In a flash, it is holding a huge "
"medieval axe in one robed hand. "
msgstr "도끼 상인이 너무 빠르게 움직인다. 순식간에 로브에 싸인 한 손으로 거대한 중세 도끼를 쥔다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " is far too terrified to continue the robbery attempt."
msgstr "은(는) 너무 겁에 질려 강도를 계속할 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:454
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " rips an especially loud fart."
msgstr "은(는) 유난히 큰 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:456
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the axe merchant to "
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 상인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The axe merchant doesn't seem to react.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"도끼 상인은 반응이 없는 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " has no idea if "
msgstr "은(는) 확신이 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " was heard or not."
msgstr "의 말을 들었는지 모르겠다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " feels so uneasy that "
msgstr "은(는) 너무 불안하다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " leave"
msgstr "은(는) 서둘러"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " the trading camp as soon as possible."
msgstr " 상인 야영지를 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:467
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "MEDIEVAL AXE"
msgstr "중세 도끼"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:467
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
". This thing is really heavy and slow. It can hit many zombies in an area! "
"Give it to someone strong and fit."
msgstr ". 아주 무겁고 느리다. 한 구역의 좀비 여러 마리를 맞힐 수 있다! 근력과 체력이 좋은 사람에게 주자."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:472
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys an axe-shaped guitar. This would make a stylish weapon."
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 모양 기타를 산다. 멋진 무기가 될 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a fire axe. It's called this because it was what firefighters used to "
"chop up zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 소방 도끼를 산다. 소방관들이 좀비를 썰던 물건이라 그렇게 부른다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:482
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a hatchet. It's the tiniest little axe."
msgstr "은(는) 손도끼를 산다. 아주 작은 도끼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:487
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Axe Merchant"
msgstr "도끼 상인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:488
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" meets a strange and menacing figure. He or she is wearing a mask and a robe.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 기묘하고 위협적인 인물을 만난다. 남자인지 여자인지 모를 이 사람은 가면과 로브를 쓰고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:489
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I sell axes... Just axes..."
msgstr "도끼를 팔지... 도끼만..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:490
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Leave it be"
msgstr "그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:492
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " robs the merchant"
msgstr "은(는) 상인 털기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:495
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells it to COOL IT"
msgstr "은(는) 그것에게 진정하라고 하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:498
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This isn't enough food to buy anything! As consolation the merchant gives "
msgstr "아무것도 살 식량이 부족하다! 상인은 위로 삼아 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:498
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a hockey stick, which I guess is axe shaped."
msgstr "에게 하키 스틱을 준다. 도끼 모양이긴 한 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:501
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Medieval Axe for 20 food"
msgstr "중세 도끼 - 식량 20개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Electric Guitar for 10 food"
msgstr "일렉트릭 기타 - 식량 10개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Fire Axe for 6 food"
msgstr "소방 도끼 - 식량 6개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:510
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Hatchet for 3 food"
msgstr "손도끼 - 식량 3개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:527
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a flamethrower. The trader doesn't say where they got it. Try not to "
"set yourself on fire with this!"
msgstr "은(는) 화염방사기를 산다. 상인은 어디서 구했는지 말하지 않는다. 자기 몸에 불붙이지 않도록 하자!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:532
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys an automatic shotgun. NOW we're talking! You're set until you run out "
"of shells for it."
msgstr "은(는) 자동 산탄총을 산다. 이제야 제대로다! 탄약이 떨어지기 전까지는 든든하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:537
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys an assault rifle. Whoever uses this needs a lot of shooting skill to "
"handle it right!"
msgstr "은(는) 돌격소총을 산다. 제대로 다루려면 사격 기술이 꽤 높아야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:542
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys an uzi. Great for spraying bullets EVERYWHERE. Even someone great with"
" guns will have problems handling this."
msgstr "은(는) 우지를 산다. 사방에 총알을 뿌리기 좋다. 총을 잘 다루는 사람도 제어하기 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:548
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "The trader decides to show "
msgstr "상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:548
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " THE GOOD STUFF."
msgstr "에게 진짜 좋은 물건을 보여 주기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:551
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Flamethrower for 35 food"
msgstr "화염방사기 - 식량 35개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Auto-Shotgun for 25 food"
msgstr "자동 산탄총 - 식량 25개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:557
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Assault Rifle for 20 food"
msgstr "돌격소총 - 식량 20개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Uzi for 12 food"
msgstr "우지 - 식량 12개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a shotgun. What a classic choice! This weapon is good in the hands of "
"nearly anyone."
msgstr "은(는) 산탄총을 산다. 클래식한 선택이다! 누구 손에 들어가도 거의 쓸 만하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:570
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a cowboy rifle. Just like the cowboys used. Someone with good shooting"
" skill could really make this work."
msgstr "은(는) 카우보이 소총을 산다. 카우보이들이 쓰던 바로 그 물건이다. 사격 기술이 좋은 사람에게는 꽤 유용하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a revolver. In the right hands, this could let someone using cheap "
"bullets do a lot of zombie damage."
msgstr "은(는) 리볼버를 산다. 제대로 다루면 싼 총알로도 좀비에게 큰 피해를 줄 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:580
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a pistol. It was very cheap, but this is the same type one can find "
"anywhere."
msgstr "은(는) 권총을 산다. 아주 싸지만 어디서든 볼 수 있는 흔한 물건이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:585
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Mobile Gun Show"
msgstr "이동식 총기 박람회"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:586
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" finds a man selling a bunch of firearms. He's holding a minigun that has a scope, a laser sight, and a flashlight attached to it. \r\n"
"\tHowever, his selection seems like pretty common stuff."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 총기를 잔뜩 파는 남자를 발견한다. 그는 조준경, 레이저 조준기, 손전등이 달린 미니건을 들고 있다. \r\n"
"\t하지만 판매 목록은 꽤 흔한 물건들이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:590
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " demands to see the good stuff"
msgstr "은(는) 좋은 물건 보여 달라고 하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:593
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Sadly, this isn't enough food for trading."
msgstr "슬프게도 거래할 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:596
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Shotgun for 5 food"
msgstr "산탄총 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:599
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Cowboy Rifle for 5 food"
msgstr "카우보이 소총 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Revolver for 5 food"
msgstr "리볼버 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:604
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Pistol for 1 food"
msgstr "권총 - 식량 1개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:616
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"At the first glimmer of trouble, the trader opens his coat to reveal that he's covered in pipebombs. In a quick motion, he lights a fuse on one of them.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"문제의 낌새가 보이자마자 상인이 코트를 펼친다. 파이프 폭탄이 온몸을 뒤덮고 있다. 재빨리 하나의 도화선에 불을 붙인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:617
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" is right next to him, and has just barely enough time to deeply regret the "
"whole robbery thing."
msgstr "은(는) 바로 옆에 있고, 이 강도짓을 깊이 후회할 시간만 간신히 남는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " farts really loud at the pipebomb guy."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 남자에게 정말 큰 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the pipebomb guy to "
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 남자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "He interprets this as "
msgstr "그는 이렇게 해석한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" playing hardball with the trade.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 거래에서 세게 흥정하려는 것이다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "NO! TAKE MY BOMBS! FREE SAMPLES!"
msgstr "아니! 내 폭탄 가져가! 무료 샘플이야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " 20 pipebombs! That's a massive amount!"
msgstr "에게 파이프 폭탄 20개를 준다! 엄청난 양이다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "YOU COOL IT! YOU COOL IT!!"
msgstr "네가 진정해! 네가 진정하라고!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe mood gets pretty tense with the guy selling explosives, so "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t폭발물 판매자와 분위기가 꽤 험악해진다. 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " has to leave the trader camp."
msgstr "은(는) 상인 야영지를 떠나야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:638
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:703
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " The trader gives "
msgstr " 상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:638
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" an extra pipebomb in an extremely awkward attempt at either flirting or "
"friendliness. It's hard to say for sure."
msgstr ""
"에게 파이프 폭탄 하나를 더 준다. 작업을 걸려는 건지 친절하게 구는 건지 모를 지극히 어색한 시도다. 확실히 말하기는 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:642
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys 8 pipebombs."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 8개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:647
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys 5 pipebombs."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 5개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:652
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys 2 pipebombs."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 2개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:657
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Pipebomb Supplier"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 공급자"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:658
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" finds a twitchy man selling homemade bombs. He's wearing a bulky coat with lumps bulging out from underneath.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 수제 폭탄을 파는 불안한 남자를 발견한다. 두툼한 코트를 입었고 안에서 덩어리들이 불룩 튀어나와 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:659
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "BUY MY BOMBS!"
msgstr "내 폭탄 사!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:660
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Back away slowly"
msgstr "천천히 뒤로 물러나기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:668
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Sadly, this isn't enough food for trading, though he does give away a free "
"pipebomb!"
msgstr "슬프게도 거래할 식량이 부족하다. 그래도 파이프 폭탄 하나를 공짜로 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:672
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "8 pipebombs for 15 food"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 8개 - 식량 15개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:675
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "5 pipebombs for 10 food"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 5개 - 식량 10개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:678
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "2 pipebombs for 5 food"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 2개 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" robs the trader of some swords and shuriken, but smashes some perfectly "
"usable animes in the process. "
msgstr "은(는) 상인에게서 검과 수리검을 조금 턴다. 하지만 그러다가 멀쩡히 쓸 수 있는 애니메이션 몇 개를 박살낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:694
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " dragged into it."
msgstr "도 휘말린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:698
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" is foiled when the trader runs in his vehicle, snaps the truck's armored "
"shutters closed, and then drives away."
msgstr "은(는) 실패한다. 상인이 차에 뛰어들어 트럭의 장갑 셔터를 닫고 운전해 도망간다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:703
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" an extra katana.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 여분의 카타나를 준다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:704
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "PROMOTIONAL OFFER, JUST FOR YOU! *WINK*"
msgstr "특별 행사, 너한테만! *윙크*"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:709
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a gigantic throwing star.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 거대한 수리검을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:710
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"THIS IS THE OFFICIAL WINDSTAR USED IN THE LIVE-ACTION VERSION OF THE "
"WINDSTAR ANIME!! EXCELLENT CHOICE!"
msgstr "윈드스타 애니메이션 실사판에서 쓰인 공식 윈드스타야!! 탁월한 선택!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:729
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys an anime figurine. It seems really expensive...\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 애니메이션 피규어를 산다. 정말 비싸 보인다...\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:730
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I CAN TELL YOU HAVE EXQUISITE TASTES!"
msgstr "네 취향이 아주 고상한 걸 알겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:735
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys 4 katanas.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 카타나 네 자루를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:736
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "ENOUGH FOR A WHOLE GROUP! CUT THROUGH ANYTHING!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 쓰기에 충분해! 뭐든 베어 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:741
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys 5 Shuriken.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 수리검 다섯 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:742
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "INCREDIBLE DEAL!"
msgstr "놀라운 거래!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:747
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" destroys some anime, as a protest against the very existence of anime. The "
"anime trader gets the message."
msgstr "은(는) 애니메이션이라는 존재 자체에 항의하며 애니메이션 몇 개를 부순다. 애니메이션 상인은 그 뜻을 알아듣는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the anime trader to "
msgstr "은(는) 애니메이션 상인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"COOL IT. \r\n"
"\tALSO, ANIME ISN'T REAL!"
msgstr ""
"진정해. \r\n"
"\t그리고 애니메이션은 현실이 아니야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"There is no way that he could take this well.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"좋게 받아들일 가능성은 없다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:753
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "NO! YOU'RE WRONG! STOP IT! NOooooooo!"
msgstr "아니! 네가 틀렸어! 그만해! 안 돼에에에에!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:753
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe enters the truck and then peels out in anger and confusion. The other traders are shocked!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그가 트럭에 들어가 분노와 혼란 속에 급출발한다. 다른 상인들은 충격을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" does her catch phrase.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 특유의 대사를 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:761
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Ahem. "
msgstr "에헴. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:761
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "'Love Beam'"
msgstr "'러브 빔'"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:761
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " *cough*"
msgstr " *콜록*"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "The anime man "
msgstr "애니메이션 남자가 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "FLIPS OUT"
msgstr "완전히 흥분한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" and gives up his entire stock and a lot of his personal food supply as "
"gifts!"
msgstr " . 재고 전부와 자기 식량도 잔뜩 선물로 내놓는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:767
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "The Last Anime Sale"
msgstr "최후의 애니메이션 판매"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:768
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This man is selling anime and anime accessories from a converted food truck."
msgstr "남자가 개조한 푸드 트럭에서 애니메이션과 관련 상품을 팔고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:770
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " FLIPS OUT"
msgstr "은(는) 완전히 흥분한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:770
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " over the Anime Truck!"
msgstr " . 애니메이션 트럭을 보고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:773
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I AM DOING MY PART TO KEEP CIVILIZATION TOGETHER, ONE ANIME SALE AT A TIME!"
msgstr "한 번에 하나씩 애니메이션을 팔며 문명을 지키는 데 힘을 보태고 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:776
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Buy NO anime"
msgstr "애니메이션 안 사기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " says her anime catch phrase"
msgstr "은(는) 특유의 애니메이션 대사 하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:787
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Sadly, this isn't enough food for anime, though he gives away a free "
"shuriken as a souvenir."
msgstr "슬프게도 애니메이션을 살 식량이 부족하다. 그래도 기념품으로 수리검 하나를 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:791
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Windstar for 15 food"
msgstr "윈드스타 - 식량 15개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:794
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Anime Figurine for 10 food"
msgstr "애니메이션 피규어 - 식량 10개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:797
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "4 Katanas for 5 food"
msgstr "카타나 4자루 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:800
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "5 Shuriken for 1 food"
msgstr "수리검 5개 - 식량 1개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "The Blunt Master fends off "
msgstr "둔기의 달인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " by throwing a bunch of hammers at them, including a sledgehammer. "
msgstr "을(를) 큰 망치를 비롯한 온갖 망치를 던져 막아낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " grabs them from the ground."
msgstr "은(는) 바닥에서 망치들을 줍는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:817
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " gnaws on one of the Blunt Master's sledgehammers."
msgstr "은(는) 둔기의 달인의 큰 망치 하나를 갉아먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:819
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the Blunt Master to "
msgstr "은(는) 둔기의 달인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:822
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"She chuckles.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그녀가 작게 웃는다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:823
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Finally! Someone who understands the importance of taking it easy! It's "
"about time."
msgstr "드디어! 느긋하게 사는 게 얼마나 중요한지 아는 사람이 왔네! 이제야 말이야."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:823
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe Blunt Master gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t둔기의 달인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " her best weapon, a "
msgstr "에게 최고의 무기인 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Mega Maul."
msgstr "메가 몰을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:827
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Her mellow mood is ruined.\r\n"
"\t\tShe starts throwing hammers in a blind rage. "
msgstr ""
"느긋한 기분이 망가진다.\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 눈에 뵈는 게 없이 화를 내며 망치들을 던지기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:828
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:927
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " is forced to flee the trading camp."
msgstr "은(는) 상인 야영지에서 도망쳐야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:833
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "SPECIAL DEAL"
msgstr "특별 행사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:834
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "For today only! Here's a ton of blunt weapons!"
msgstr "오늘만! 둔기가 한가득!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:841
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "MEGA MAUL"
msgstr "메가 몰"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:841
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
", as once seen on TV. Can smash up to 3 zombies at once, if you're lucky. Just like in the old commercials.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
". 예전에 TV에서 본 그 물건이다. 운이 좋으면 좀비 세 마리를 한 번에 박살낸다. 옛날 광고 그대로다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:842
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Th-the King of Hammers. I only sold it this cheap because you're a fellow "
"blunt weapons fan."
msgstr "마, 망치의 왕이지. 같은 둔기 팬이라서 이렇게 싸게 판 거야."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:847
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a sledgehammer. You're ready to smash some zombies.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 큰 망치를 산다. 좀비를 박살낼 준비가 됐다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:848
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Now we're getting somewhere! This is a powerful blunt weapon, if you have "
"the strength and fitness for it."
msgstr "이제야 제대로네! 근력과 체력이 받쳐 주면 강력한 둔기지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a heavy ballpeen hammer.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 무거운 볼핀 망치를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:854
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Perfect for zombie skulls! I have lots more, if you need extras."
msgstr "좀비 두개골에 딱이야! 더 필요하면 잔뜩 있으니까."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:859
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a shiny new claw hammer. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 번쩍이는 새 장도리를 산다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:860
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Thanks for the trade. I have a countless amount of these."
msgstr "거래 고마워. 이건 셀 수도 없이 많아."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:865
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Blunt Master"
msgstr "둔기의 달인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:866
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" meets a woman who is covered in hammers. They hang from several toolbelts and bandoliers.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 온몸에 망치가 달린 여성을 만난다. 여러 공구 벨트와 멜빵띠에 매달려 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:867
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Can I tell you a secret?\r\n"
"\tI love blunt weapons. I'll sell you my spares, cheap!"
msgstr ""
"비밀 하나 말해 줄까?\r\n"
"\t난 둔기가 좋아. 남는 건 싸게 팔게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:877
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a wooden log, nature's blunt weapon."
msgstr "에게 자연의 둔기인 통나무를 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:881
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "SPECIAL DEAL TODAY"
msgstr "오늘의 특별 행사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:881
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " for 8 food!"
msgstr " - 식량 8개!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:885
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Mega Maul for 16 food"
msgstr "메가 몰 - 식량 16개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:889
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Sledgehammer for 8 food"
msgstr "큰 망치 - 식량 8개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:892
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Ballpeen Hammer for 3 food"
msgstr "볼핀 망치 - 식량 3개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:895
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Claw Hammer for 2 food"
msgstr "장도리 - 식량 2개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:910
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"The polearm trader twirls his spear around and then throws it right into "
msgstr "장병기 상인이 창을 빙빙 돌리더니 곧장 던진다. 표적: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:910
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\t\tNice! Free spear!"
msgstr ""
"!\r\n"
"\t\t좋다! 공짜 창이다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:916
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " gnaws on one of the polearm trader's polearms."
msgstr "은(는) 장병기 상인의 장병기 하나를 갉아먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:918
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " tells the polearm trader to "
msgstr "은(는) 장병기 상인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:921
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"He looks lost in his memories.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그는 추억에 잠긴 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:922
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "You remind me of my old master, the Polearm Prince!"
msgstr "너를 보니 옛 스승, 장병기 왕자가 생각나는구나!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:922
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe polearm Master gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t장병기 달인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:923
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " his best weapon, a "
msgstr "에게 최고의 무기인 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:923
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Bardiche."
msgstr "바르디시를 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:926
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"He is not pleased by this at all.\r\n"
"\t\tHe starts twirling his spear in an aggressive manner. "
msgstr ""
"그는 전혀 기뻐하지 않는다.\r\n"
"\t\t공격적으로 창을 빙빙 돌리기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "BARDICHE"
msgstr "바르디시"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:933
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Be careful swinging this, it's very heavy! Lift with your knees, not with "
"your back."
msgstr "아주 무거우니 조심해서 휘둘러! 허리 말고 무릎으로 들어 올려."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:938
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a spear the trader made."
msgstr "은(는) 상인이 만든 창을 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:940
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This is the latest model in zombie spearing design! Very easy to use. Very tactical.\r\n"
"\t\t\tThe leverage also makes it take about half the effort to attack with compared to most other weapons!"
msgstr ""
"최신형 좀비 찌르기 설계야! 아주 쓰기 쉽고 아주 전술적이지.\r\n"
"\t\t\t지렛대 원리 덕분에 대부분의 다른 무기보다 힘도 절반쯤 들고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:944
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "This is the last one I have in stock. I hope your phalanx works out!"
msgstr "재고의 마지막 창이야. 네 팔랑크스가 잘 되길 바라!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:950
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a pike. It's almost as long as a car!"
msgstr "은(는) 장창을 산다. 길이가 거의 차만 하다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:952
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I pilfered these from a museum. Don't ask. \r\n"
"\t\t\tNot only are they powerful, but they have tremendous range. Fight with ease! A group of pikes can be quite intimidating."
msgstr ""
"박물관에서 슬쩍해 왔어. 묻지 마. \r\n"
"\t\t\t강력할 뿐만 아니라 사거리도 엄청나지. 편하게 싸워! 장창 부대는 꽤 위협적이야."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:956
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "This is my last pike. Cavalry would be wise to steer clear of you!"
msgstr "마지막 장창이야. 기병도 네 주변을 피하는 게 좋겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:962
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a shoe attached to a stick.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 막대기에 붙인 신발을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:963
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I invented this! Patent pending!\r\n"
"\tThe kinks are still being worked out. No refunds."
msgstr ""
"내 발명품이야! 특허 출원 중이지!\r\n"
"\t아직 문제점들을 고치는 중이야. 환불은 안 돼."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:969
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a pitchfork.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쇠스랑을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:970
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I have a lot of these for sale! They're a little plain, but they work."
msgstr "이건 잔뜩 팔고 있어! 조금 평범하지만 쓸 만하지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:975
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Polearm Pal"
msgstr "장병기 친구"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:976
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" meets a man wielding a homemade spear. Despite being a knife tied to a stick, it seems like it would be a really effective weapon.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 수제 창을 휘두르는 남자를 만난다. 막대기에 칼을 묶었을 뿐인데 꽤 효과적인 무기로 보인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:977
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Nothing beats polearms for zombie hunting!"
msgstr "좀비 사냥에는 장병기가 최고야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:986
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a pool cue."
msgstr "에게 당구 큐대를 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:989
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Bardiche for 25 food"
msgstr "바르디시 - 식량 25개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:992
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Steel Pike for 16 food"
msgstr "강철 장창 - 식량 16개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:995
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Tactical Spear for 9 food"
msgstr "전술 창 - 식량 9개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:998
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Stick Boot for 6 food"
msgstr "막대기 장화 - 식량 6개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1001
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Pitchfork for 3 food"
msgstr "쇠스랑 - 식량 3개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1013
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a quiet shotgun.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 조용한 산탄총을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1014
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This solves the usual problem with shotguns, attracting every zombie in town. \r\n"
"\tThe speed on this is right between a shotgun and an autoshotgun. It can do some damage."
msgstr ""
"동네 좀비를 전부 불러 모으는 산탄총의 흔한 문제를 해결했지. \r\n"
"\t발사 속도는 산탄총과 자동 산탄총의 딱 중간이야. 피해도 꽤 줄 수 있고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1020
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a sniper rifle!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 저격소총을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1021
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Nice choice. This is my favorite.\r\n"
"\tI've modified it to have a very high potential for piercing. In the hands of an expert, it could blast an entire line of zombies in one shot. At long range, in near silence."
msgstr ""
"좋은 선택이야. 내가 제일 좋아하지.\r\n"
"\t관통력이 아주 높아질 수 있도록 개조했어. 전문가 손에 들어가면 한 발로 좀비 한 줄 전체를 날려 버릴 수 있지. 먼 거리에서, 거의 소리도 없이."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1027
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a silenced pistol."
msgstr "은(는) 소음 권총을 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1029
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I have a few more for sale, if you want silent fireams for a whole group!"
msgstr "일행 전원이 조용한 총을 갖고 싶으면 몇 자루 더 팔 수 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1032
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "This is my last pistol. Enjoy your new silent but deadly arsenal!"
msgstr "마지막 권총이야. 소리 없이 치명적인 새 무기들을 즐겨 봐!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1038
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Silent But Deadly"
msgstr "소리 없이 치명적"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1039
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This suspicious person is wearing a mask and holding a fancy silenced sniper rifle.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"수상한 사람이 가면을 쓰고 멋진 소음 저격소총을 들고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1040
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "My weapons are so quiet. You'll attract much less zombies per shot."
msgstr "내 무기는 아주 조용해. 한 발 쏠 때마다 끌려오는 좀비가 훨씬 적지."
